\b Key Points:\b0\par
\bullet 100% local - all processing happens on your device\par
\bullet No data is collected, sent, or stored externally\par
\bullet No telemetry, no analytics, no tracking\par
\bullet No accounts required\par
\bullet Open source - see LICENSE file for full terms\par\par
\b Data Privacy:\b0\par
This app reads your currently playing track from the Windows Media Session (SMTC) and fetches lyrics from LRCLIB and Qobuzify (free public APIs). Album art is read from your local media session. No personal data, listening history, or identifiers are ever transmitted.\par\par
The only network requests made are:\par
\bullet Lyrics lookup (track name + artist name to LRCLIB/Qobuzify)\par
\bullet Album art lookup (track name + artist name to Deezer/iTunes)\par
\bullet Update check (version number to GitHub)\par\par
No other data leaves your machine.\par\par
